re_price_desc:`See an estimate before requesting. The carrier’s displayed tariff and taximeter determine the final fare.`,feature_fast_title:`Fast arrival`,feature_fast_desc:`Follow the request status in the app. Arrival time depends on availability and traffic.`,feature_safe_title:`Driver details`,feature_safe_desc:`See driver and vehicle details after acceptance. Paid taxi transport requires the applicable valid documents.`,feature_pay_title:`Pay in cash`,feature_pay_desc:`Pay the driver in cash after your ride.`,feature_share_title:`Share your trip`,feature_share_desc:`Send your live location and arrival to a loved one — for total peace of mind.`,how_title:`How it works?`,how_subtitle:`Three steps and you are on your way.`,how_step1_title:`Order a carriage`,how_step1_desc:`Set your pickup address and destination in the app.`,how_step2_title:`Track live`,how_step2_desc:`See the driver on the map and how long until they reach you.`,how_step3_title:`Ride comfortably`,how_step3_desc:`Travel, pay the driver in cash and rate your trip.`,routes_title:`Popular routes in Levski`,routes_subtitle:`Select a route and check the estimated fare in the app.`,routes_view_all:`See full pricing`,route_center_train:`Centre → Train station`,route_center_bus:`Centre → Bus station`,route_municipality_park:`Municipality → City park`,route_train_stadium:`Train station → Stadium`,route_medical_center:`Medical centre → Centre`,route_price:`In the app`,route_price2:`In the app`,route_price3:`In the app`,route_price4:`In the app`,route_price5:`In the app`,testimonials_title:`What riders say`,testimonials_subtitle:`People in Levski already ride with Leski Carriage.`,testimonial_1:`I order from home and the carriage comes in minutes. The price is clear before I even start — just as it should be.`,testimonial_1_name:`Maria Petrova`,testimonial_1_role:`Levski`,testimonial_2:`I use the app every day for work. It always arrives on time and I can track the driver live.`,testimonial_2_name:`Ivan Georgiev`,testimonial_2_role:`Levski`,testimonial_3:`The most convenient thing in town. I stop a carriage with one tap, even when it is raining.`,testimonial_3_name:`Elena Dimitrova`,testimonial_3_role:`Levski`,driver_title:`Become a Leski Carriage driver`,driver_desc:`Work on your own schedule, whenever you want. We bring the riders, you bring the smiles.`,driver_benefit_1:`Work when you want`,driver_benefit_2:`Transparent earnings`,driver_benefit_3:`Daily support`,driver_cta:`Apply now`,cta_title:`Ready to order your carriage?`,cta_subtitle:`Order straight from the website — we are everywhere in Levski.`,cta_button:`Order your carriage now`,footer_tagline:`A platform connecting customers, drivers and taxi companies in Levski and the surrounding region.`,footer_company:`Company`,footer_services:`Transport requests`,footer_contact:`Contact`,footer_service_1:`Requests within town`,footer_service_2:`Requests to the bus station`,footer_service_3:`Requests to the train station`,footer_service_4:`Connect with local drivers`,footer_address:`Levski, Pleven Province`,footer_phone:`+359 89 000 5900`,footer_email:`vladiata39@gmail.com`,contact_privacy_label:`Personal data controller`,contact_privacy_email:`For privacy rights and deletion requests, email`,footer_rights:`All rights reserved.`,about_hero_badge:`About us`,about_hero_title:`We built the carriage for our town`,about_hero_subtitle:`Leski Karuchka connects people who need transport in Levski with drivers and taxi companies. They provide the transport.`,about_story_title:`Our story`,about_story_p1:`The idea started in Levski: make it easier to find a local transport provider and send a request from your phone.`,about_story_p2:`We built Leski Karuchka as a digital intermediary, with simple requests, fare estimates and tracking of accepted trips. The transport contract is with the company or person providing the ride.`,about_mission_desc:`To make connecting passengers with local transport providers easier, through clear information and convenient requests.`,about_values_title:`What we value`,about_value_1_title:`Honesty`,about_value_1_desc:`An estimate is clearly distinguished from the final fare under the carrier’s tariff.`,about_value_2_title:`Punctuality`,about_value_2_desc:`Follow the status of your request and receive updated information.`,about_value_3_title:`Care`,about_value_3_desc:`We help customers and drivers connect and provide support for the app.`,about_zone_title:`Where we work`,about_zone_desc:`Our focus is Levski and the region. Trips depend on an available carrier authorised for the relevant territory.`,about_faq_title:`Frequently asked questions`,faq_q1:`How do I order a carriage?`,faq_a1:`Register in the app, choose your pickup and destination, then press “Order a carriage”.`,faq_q2:`Can I pay in cash?`,faq_a2:`Yes — payment is cash only, directly to the driver.`,faq_q3:`How long do I wait for a carriage in Levski?`,faq_a3:`Availability and arrival times depend on drivers and traffic. Follow the status of your request in the app.`,faq_q4:`How much does a ride cost?`,faq_a4:`An estimate is calculated for your route. For taxi transport the displayed carrier tariff and taximeter determine the final fare.`,pricing_hero_badge:`Pricing`,pricing_hero_title:`Clear fare information`,pricing_hero_subtitle:`The app estimate helps you plan. The carrier is responsible for its tariff and final fare.`,pricing_fare_start:`Base fare`,pricing_fare_km:`Price per km`,pricing_fare_min:`Price per minute`,pricing_fare_min_total:`Minimum fare`,pricing_fare_1:`€2.00`,pricing_fare_2:`€1.10`,pricing_fare_3:`€0.28`,pricing_fare_4:`€3.00`,pricing_vehicles_badge:`Types`,pricing_vehicles_title:`Choose your carriage type`,pricing_std:`Standard`,pricing_std_desc:`An economical carriage for everyday rides in town.`,pricing_comfort:`Comfort`,pricing_comfort_desc:`A more spacious carriage, ideal for families and luggage.`,pricing_from:`from`,pricing_routes_title:`Sample routes`,pricing_routes_subtitle:`Estimated fares for rides within Levski.`,pricing_routes_note:`The exact price depends on distance, traffic and the chosen carriage type.`,pricing_pay_title:`Cash payment`,pricing_pay_desc:`Pay the driver in cash after the trip and receive the required fiscal receipt from the carrier.`,pricing_faq_title:`Questions about prices`,pfaq_q1:`Why does the price change?`,pfaq_a1:`The estimate depends on the route and configured tariff. Traffic, waiting time and the actual route affect the final fare.`,pfaq_q2:`Is there a night fare?`,pfaq_a2:`Check the carrier’s displayed daytime or nighttime tariff before travelling.`,pfaq_q3:`Can I schedule a carriage for a specific time?`,pfaq_a3:`Scheduled rides are coming soon. For now you order on demand.`,driver_join_hero_badge:`For drivers`,driver_join_hero_title:`Drive a carriage. Earn. Be free.`,driver_join_hero_subtitle:`Register as a partner and receive requests from people looking for transport in the region.`,dj_benefit_1_title:`Flexible hours`,dj_benefit_1_desc:`Go online whenever you want — morning, evening or weekend.`,dj_benefit_2_title:`Transparent earnings`,dj_benefit_2_desc:`See exactly how much you earn from every ride.`,dj_benefit_3_title:`Regular riders`,dj_benefit_3_desc:`We handle the orders, you take care of the riders.`,dj_benefit_4_title:`Support`,dj_benefit_4_desc:`Our team is there for you every day.`,dj_req_title:`What you need`,dj_req_1:`Valid driving licence and the required taxi driver certificate`,dj_req_2:`Registered carrier and a vehicle permit for the relevant municipality`,dj_req_3:`Compliant vehicle, taximeter, insurance and required inspections`,dj_req_4:`Documents checked before activation; applying does not authorise transport`,dj_form_title:`Apply now`,dj_form_subtitle:`Fill in the form and we will get back to you within 2 business days.`,dj_form_name:`Full name`,dj_form_phone:`Phone`,dj_form_email:`Email`,dj_form_exp:`Years of driving experience`,dj_form_vehicle:`Do you own a car?`,dj_form_